- create the compressed archive by executing the command
  './create_installation',
- install the compressed archive ('geomec_rgi.tar.bz2') by executing the
  commands 'mkdir test', './install test',
- the installation can now be verified by executing the commands 'cd test',
  './test_geomec_rgi'.
- due to an unknown and unresolved issue the test may have to be executed
  several times before the result 'TEST SUCCEEDED' is returned.
